===Verb===
'''любить''' (ljubít’) {{impf}}, [[полюбить]] (poljubít’) {{pf}}

# to [[love]], to [[like]], to be [[fond]] of, to grow fond of ''(only in the emotional sense; for culinary purposes, see [[нравиться]])''

